@startuml
title 2번 슬라이드. 토큰은 직접 들고 다니지 않고 Gateway 세션으로 관리한다

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 18
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #86EFAC
  FontColor #166534
}

left to right direction

rectangle "GatewayOidcController" as OidcController #DBEAFE
rectangle "GatewayLoginService" as LoginService #FEF3C7
rectangle "GatewayAuthorizationStateService\nstate 저장/소비" as AuthState #DCFCE7
rectangle "GatewayOidcTokenClient\n인가코드 / refresh token 교환" as TokenClient #F8FAFC
rectangle "GatewaySessionTokenCipher\nGatewayRefreshTokenHasher" as TokenProtection #FDE68A
rectangle "RedisGatewaySessionRepository\nGatewayServerSession 저장" as SessionRepo #F8FAFC
rectangle "GatewaySessionCookieManager\nDONMOA_SESSION 쿠키 발급" as CookieManager #DBEAFE

OidcController --> LoginService
LoginService --> AuthState
LoginService --> TokenClient
LoginService --> TokenProtection
LoginService --> SessionRepo
LoginService --> CookieManager

note bottom of TokenProtection
refresh token은 평문으로 저장하지 않고
암호화 값과 hash를 함께 세션에 저장한다.
end note

note bottom of CookieManager
브라우저는 access token 자체가 아니라
gateway session id가 담긴 쿠키를 가진다.
end note

@enduml
